<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates drop to 7.33 percent.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates drop to 7.33 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar dropped fractionally to 7.33 percent on Wednesday from 7.35 percent on Tuesday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said five banks traded on the market in 17 reported transactions with a total value of 24.5 million dinars ($34 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.708 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
